==Description==
The '''Chatty Nametag''' is an {{Color|Exclusive}} nametag which was originally added alongside the other [[v1.8.0]] nametags, though unlike them it went unused. As it is based on Discord, it was likely originally a Discord reward which went unused, similar to the [[Follower Nametag]].

The '''Chatty Nametag''' has purple gradient text with a translucent black outline. Multiple speech bubbles appear around it, which either contain a happy face or three dots.

